   # 歧路引灯
   gts_xinuo.201.name: "Guiding Lamp on Divergent Path"
   # 借助强劲的设备，我们可以轻易挖掘土壤表层，1400米的深度根本难不倒我们，挖掘设备轻松的破开了土层，为了避免损坏地下的宝藏，我们调整着设备慢慢向下，自动形成的台阶让我们可以安全向下，随后[Root.leader.GetName]将自己缩小到与小人们同样的大小进入。\n\n声波探测装置发出的脉冲扫描着周围的环境，这上面确实只有一层土壤，并没有任何防御，但究竟是怎么屏蔽了我们科研船的探测设备，这更耐人寻味，在考古团队向下走了一段距离后，地层的晃动消失，估计是破碎机完成了自己的任务停了下来。考古团队加快了脚步，十五分钟后在下面看到了破碎机显示器的绿色光芒，在设置返回任务后，她沿着来时的通道缓慢上行，而科研团队则开始人工勘探。\n\n又是一个小时的时间过去，研究员们终于到达了目标深度，坚实的金属天花板出现在了我们的脚下，这或许就是研究院的防御工事，依靠着声波探测器，考古团队找到了多条道路，似乎每一个都通向这个星球的一个主要城市，但当务之急是寻找一个进出设施的地方，在向一边继续挖掘后，一个宽敞的地下洞穴出现在考古团队面前，研究院所在的地方只是这个地下洞穴小小的一部分，在采用激光测距后，这个洞穴的直径达到了420公里，在这样的空间下，无论是高速公路还是生产设施都被布置在了一个坚实的平台上，建筑被统一刷成白色，似乎是为了在地下的黑暗环境提高辨识度，街道两旁矗立的路灯如同忠诚的卫士一般，即使整个地下设施被废弃，它依然挺立。
-  gts_xinuo.201.desc: "With powerful equipment, we can easily excavate the soil surface layer. 1400 meters depth doesn't baffle us at all. Excavation equipment easily broke through the soil layer. To avoid damaging underground treasures, we adjusted the equipment to go down slowly. Automatically formed steps allowed us to go down safely. Then [Root.leader.GetName] shrank herself to the same size as small folk to enter.\n\n[Repeat of part of 101.desc logic]"
+  gts_xinuo.201.desc: "With our powerful equipment, we could easily dig through the topsoil; a depth of 1,400 meters was no challenge at all. The excavator effortlessly broke through the soil layers. To avoid damaging the underground treasure, we adjusted the equipment and descended slowly; the naturally formed steps allowed us to descend safely. Then, [Root.leader.GetName] shrank himself to the same size as the little people and entered. \n\nPulses from the sonar device scanned the surrounding environment. There was indeed only a layer of soil here, with no defenses whatsoever. But how exactly had they managed to block our research vessel's detection equipment? That was even more intriguing. After the archaeological team had descended a short distance, the tremors in the ground ceased—presumably because the crusher had completed its task and stopped. The archaeological team quickened their pace. Fifteen minutes later, they spotted the green glow of the crusher's display below. After programming the return mission, she slowly ascended along the passage they had come through, while the research team began manual exploration.\n\nAnother hour passed before the researchers finally reached the target depth, where a solid metal ceiling appeared beneath their feet. which might well be the research institute's defensive fortifications. Using sonar detectors, the archaeological team identified multiple pathways, each seemingly leading to one of the planet's major cities. However, the immediate priority was to find an entrance or exit to the facility. After continuing to excavate in one direction, a spacious underground cavern opened up before the team. The research institute's location was merely a small part of this cavern. After conducting laser ranging, the cavern's diameter was measured at 420 kilometers. In such a vast space, everything from highways to production facilities was laid out on a solid platform. The buildings were uniformly painted white, seemingly to improve visibility in the dark underground environment. Streetlights stood tall on either side of the roads like loyal sentinels, remaining steadfast even after the entire underground facility had been abandoned."
   # 钢铁的国家已然逝去，国家的钢铁依然挺立。
   gts_xinuo.201.a: "The nation of steel has passed, the steel of the nation still stands."
   # 往日之影
   gts_xinuo.202.name: "Shadow of the Past"
   # 部署软梯后，考古团队沿着墙壁下去，手电的光线刺入黑暗的心脏，驱散了地下的阴霾。沿着白色的走廊向前，一道高耸的钢铁大门出现在了我们的眼前，似乎是因为失去电力的缘故，厚重的大门虚掩着，考古团队正好可以借此进入研究院。\n\n室内杂乱不堪，手电光照射的地方全是散落的纸片，队员们收集着纸片，拼凑着数据，一个针对星神兽的基因计划浮出了水面，早已消失的帝国竟然通过提取星神兽的基因来制造生物兵器，但现有的数据大多都是废弃的，考古团队必须继续深入，寻找更多有效信息，希望一切顺利。\n\n考古团队摸索着前进，虽然这里并没有交火的痕迹，但许多东西早已被人为破坏，甚至还有焚烧的痕迹，不知是否是紧急销毁实验数据，失落的帝国到底被什么入侵，以至于他们如此恐惧？在建筑中不断搜索着，考古团队并没有什么发现，但启动的声波探测装置却在一面光滑的墙后找到了一条通往更深地区的隧道。这种桥段真像古代小说里的剧情，或许我们应该进去看看？
-  gts_xinuo.202.desc: "[Duplicate of 102.desc]"
+  gts_xinuo.202.desc: "After deploying the rope ladder, the archaeological team went down along the wall. Flashlight beams pierced the heart of darkness, dispelling the underground haze. Moving forward along the white corridor, a towering steel gate appeared in front of us. It seemed that due to power loss, the heavy gate was left ajar, just right for the archaeological team to enter the institute.\n\nThe room was messy. Places illuminated by flashlights were full of scattered papers. The team members collected papers and pieced together data. A gene plan targeting Star Gods surfaced. The long-gone empire actually created biological weapons by extracting Star God genes. But existing data was mostly scrapped. The archaeological team must go deeper to find more effective information. Ideally everything goes smoothly.\n\nThe archaeological team groped forward. Although there were no traces of crossfire here, many things had long been artificially destroyed, and there were even traces of burning. Unknown if it was emergency destruction of experimental data. What invaded the lost empire to make them so fearful? Searching constantly in the building, the archaeological team found nothing. But the activated sonic probe found a tunnel leading to a deeper area behind a smooth wall. This plot is really like an ancient novel. Maybe we should go in and have a look?"
   # 埋藏着宝藏的地下室？真是有趣......
   gts_xinuo.202.a: "A basement with buried treasure? Interesting..."
   # 千秋长明
   gts_xinuo.203.name: "Eternal Light"
   # 压抑......黑暗的空间总是会让人感觉不舒服，即使有小队一起行动，也难以抵挡长时间的寂静，焦虑蔓延开来，到了地下室后，这样压抑的感觉更为浓烈，一股直击心灵的震慑不断在周围产生，巨大的压力让团队的进度异常缓慢，但越靠近地下室，这样的感觉就越轻，似乎地下室有着什么东西在抵抗着心灵冲击，团队迅速转移至地下室门口，不知道这么长久的时间过去了，什么东西还能保持着这样的光芒，不过我们无法打开这扇门，门禁系统依然在工作着，这样持久的能源或许也值得我们的科研团队去研究，但当务之急依然是寻找可以打开门禁的物品，这些东西应该就散落在大厅之中。\n\n团队返回大厅，从杂乱的物品中寻找着那一丝希望，在大厅上上下下都搜索过后，一个吊牌被找到，人像与其上的字早已模糊，不过卡片应该还能使用，在将卡片放上去后，门成功打开，实验室内被一层厚厚的玻璃所围绕，一条走廊围绕着这个房间，明亮的蓝光完全驱散了地下的阴霾与沉闷，但依然没人能看清那里藏着什么，黑色的隔离门将里面与外面分割为了两个世界，再次刷卡，广播中轻柔的女声传来：\n\n§Y\"艾丝菲雅主管，欢迎回来。\"§!\n\n卡片的主人在这一刻终于被揭露，但是我们没有在收集的资料中发现任何关于这个人的信息。\n\n沉重的铁门缓缓打开，一个一人多高的培养舱出现在了众人眼前，透明的玻璃罐中一个赤身裸体的 maiden正在沉睡，及腰的蓝发随其中的液体散，头上的两只角上镶嵌着三对淡黄色的宝石，更令人吃惊的是， maiden背后有一对一人高的翅膀，翅膀向周围发射着明亮的蓝光将她包裹在其中，但这样的光亮并没有让人感到刺眼，反而用一种神奇的力量抚慰着所有人的身体，随后流入人们的精神之中，疲惫与不安一扫而空，取而代之的是一种悠闲的感觉，仿佛在此刻看到了蔚蓝的天空与碧绿的草原，但研究员们没有沉溺在这样的体验当中，他们依然在寻找着可能了解到罐中 maiden的身世，将收集到的信息总和后，一个复杂而庞大的计划被勾勒出来。
-  gts_xinuo.203.desc: "[Duplicate of 103.desc]"
+  gts_xinuo.203.desc: "Depressive... Dark spaces always make people uncomfortable. Even with a squad moving together, it's hard to resist long silence. Anxiety spread. Upon reaching the basement, this depressive feeling became stronger. A shock hitting the soul directly was constantly generated around. Huge pressure made the team's progress unusually slow. But the closer to the basement, the lighter this feeling became. It seemed something in the basement was resisting the psychic shock. The team quickly moved to the basement door. Unknown what could maintain such light after so long. However, we cannot open this door. The access control system is still working. Such lasting energy might be worth our research team's study. But the priority is still finding items to open the access control. These things should be scattered in the hall.\n\nThe team returned to the hall, searching for that glimmer of hope among messy items. After searching up and down the hall, a tag was found. The portrait and words on it were blurred long ago, but the card should still work. After placing the card, the door successfully opened. The laboratory was surrounded by a layer of thick glass. A corridor surrounded this room. Bright blue light completely dispelled the underground haze and dullness, but still no one could see clearly what was hidden there. Black isolation doors divided inside and outside into two worlds. swiping the card again, a gentle female voice came from the broadcast:\n\n§Y\"Director Esfiers, welcome back.\"§!\n\nThe owner of the card was finally revealed at this moment, but we found no information about this person in the collected data.\n\nThe heavy iron door slowly opened. A cultivation pod taller than a person appeared in front of everyone. In the transparent glass jar, a stark naked maiden was sleeping. Waist-length blue hair scattered with the liquid inside. Three pairs of light yellow gems were embedded in the two horns on her head. More surprisingly, there was a pair of person-high wings behind the maiden. The wings emitted bright blue light around, wrapping her in it. But this light was not dazzling, instead comforting everyone's body with a magical power, then flowing into people's spirits. Fatigue and anxiety were swept away, replaced by a leisurely feeling, as if seeing the blue sky and green grassland at this moment. But the researchers didn't indulge in this experience. They were still looking for the origin of the maiden in the jar. After summing up collected information, a complex and huge plan was outlined."
   # 这是一场自救，也是一次复仇。
   gts_xinuo.203.a: "This is a self-rescue, and also a revenge."
   # 不世之仇
   gts_xinuo.204.name: "Unworldly Feud"
   # 一个繁荣的帝国在千万年前崛起，在它那悠久的历史当中，它的人民不断开拓与征服，一个又一个的星球成为了其疆域内的殖民地，而这些殖民地又撑起了帝国庞大的开支，人们安居乐业，帝国稳固了自己的疆域后，联合了星海中其他的国家共同构建了一个名为星海共同体的联合组织。在对此的记载中，曾经甚至有着众多的星神兽存在于那个时期，当时的人们以科技的力量掌控着自然与神明，犽戎，紫宸，荧萘，九色，以及舱内 maiden的基因原型 -  - §B希诺§!，这些星神兽不仅是帝国的守护神，也是相互制衡的方式。下面的一张照片让考古团队看清了星神兽的体型，只见与罐中 maiden一模一样的龙娘环绕着那\"小小的\"恒星，那炽热的恒星对比龙娘的手就像个网球，随时都能被一把捏住，永远熄灭。\n\n研究员们继续分析着手中的记录，其中有一份报告中提到了天灾，这或许是他们进行基因工程的原因？他们从那巨大的龙娘的身体上提取了基因，通过生物技术孕育一个个胚胎，这样的工程是艰难的，许多胚胎在生长过程中就因为基因的缺陷死亡，最终成为了铺垫最终兵器的基石，而在我们眼前的，是少数完成了最终育成的胚胎之一，也是唯一一个存活下来的生存适应性增强胚胎，虽然根据实验数据表明她的最大体型只有基因原体的一半，但是其拥有堪比基因原体的生存适应性，能够在宇宙空间长时间作战，如果真能量产，其作战能力难以想象，但是看起来胚胎并没有在他们的国家还存在时完成，天灾席卷了他们的国家，满怀仇恨与复仇怒火的人民将这件武器深深封存，但并没有完全隔绝外人，这倒是让我们捡了个便宜，根据实验数据，这样的 maiden已经是在舱内孕育完成了，现在考古团队要做的是跟着操作指示，完成这最后的步骤，他们为我们留下的宝藏，或许是对抗那所谓天灾的最终武器。
-  gts_xinuo.204.desc: "[Duplicate of 104.desc]"
+  gts_xinuo.204.desc: "A prosperous empire rose tens of millions of years ago. In its long history, its people continuously pioneered and conquered. Planet after planet became colonies within its territory, and these colonies supported the empire's huge expenses. People lived and worked in peace. After stabilizing its territory, the empire united other nations in the star sea to build a united organization called the Galactic Community. In records of this, there were once numerous Star Gods existing in that period. People at that time controlled nature and gods with the power of technology. Yarong, Zichen, Yingnai, Jiu Se, and the gene prototype of the maiden in the pod - §B Xinuo §!. These Star Gods were not only the empire's patron gods but also checks and balances. A photo below allowed the archaeological team to see the Star God's size. A dragon girl identical to the maiden in the jar surrounded that \"small\" star. That hot star was like a tennis ball compared to the dragon girl's hand, ready to be pinched out at any time.\n\nResearchers continued analyzing records in hand. One report mentioned the Crisis. Perhaps this was the reason for their genetic engineering? They extracted genes from that huge dragon girl's body and bred embryos through biotechnology. Such a project was arduous. Many embryos died during growth due to genetic defects, finally becoming cornerstones paving the way for the ultimate weapon. And what is before us is one of the few embryos that completed final cultivation, and the only surviving survival-adaptability-enhanced embryo. Although experimental data shows her maximum size is only half of the gene primarch, she possesses survival adaptability comparable to the gene primarch and can fight in space for a long time. If she can really be mass-produced, her combat capability is unimaginable. But it seems the embryo was not completed while their country still existed. The Crisis swept their country. People full of hatred and revenge sealed this weapon deeply, but did not completely isolate outsiders. This allowed us to pick up a bargain. According to experimental data, such a maiden is already fully nurtured in the pod. Now the archaeological team needs to follow operating instructions to complete this final step. The treasure they left for us might be the ultimate weapon against that so-called Crisis."
   # 继续挖掘。
   gts_xinuo.204.a: "Continue digging."
   # 涅槃之兽
   gts_xinuo.205.name: "Beast of Nirvana"
   # 在走进房间后，科学官根据操作指南拉下了注入神经复苏剂的拉杆，连接着培养舱的管道中出现了一道绿色的溶剂，随后散开在整个培养舱之中，透明的舱壁上被粘稠的绿色薄膜所覆盖，浑浊的液体挡住了研究员们的视线，但是其中的人影似乎微微动了一下，\n\n§B\"哼......嗯......\"§!\n\n几声娇弱的喘息声从舱室内传来，正当我们科学官尽力向内观察时，一只白皙的手突然重重拍在内壁的玻璃上，随后一张完美无瑕的脸庞从浑浊的水中浮现，耳后三片蓝色的鳍片飘荡水中，好像童话中的美人鱼一般，琥珀色的眼睛死死盯着正在看着科学官，眼神中充满了疑虑与愤怒，捏成拳头的双手按压着内壁，咔擦咔擦的玻璃破碎声响起，蛛网般的裂痕以 maiden双手为中心散开。\n\n科学官紧急拉下复位按钮，周围的粘稠的绿色薄膜瞬间向后收缩，看似柔软的薄膜紧紧贴在 maiden的肌肤上，刚刚能靠力量压裂玻璃的 maiden此刻却像蝉蛹一样被牢牢包裹住，即使 maiden不断挣扎也无法逃离这样的束缚，科学官借此机会按下了紧急按钮，一阵白色雾气被注入其中，具有镇定效果的溶剂让 maiden的挣扎逐渐减弱，眼神也平静下来，面无表情地看着舱外的众人，在确定了 maiden没有进一步威胁后，众人继续研究着这些遗落的资料，通用文书写的资料倒是不难解读，但是有些名词缺太过生僻，抑或是古老，难以被理解，只能依靠研究员们一步步去尝试，不过这中间倒是没出什么差错，在顺利完成最终的阶段后，控制面板上的§Y\"success\"§!让众人松了一口气，或许等待这进度完成后，我们就能知道在重重防御之下的 maiden有什么样特别的地方了。
-  gts_xinuo.205.desc: "[Duplicate of 105.desc]"
+  gts_xinuo.205.desc: "After walking into the room, the science officer pulled down the lever to inject neural resuscitation agent according to the operation guide. A green solvent appeared in the pipe connected to the cultivation pod, then spread throughout the pod. The transparent pod wall was covered by a sticky green film. Turbid liquid blocked the researchers' sight, but the figure inside seemed to move slightly.\n\n§B\"Hmph... hmm...\"§!\n\nA few delicate gasps came from the chamber. Just as our science officer tried to look inside, a fair hand suddenly slapped heavily on the inner glass wall. Then a flawless face emerged from the turbid water. Three blue fins behind her ears floated in the water, like a mermaid in a fairy tale. Amber eyes stared dead at the science officer, eyes full of doubt and anger. Fists pressed against the inner wall. The sound of cracking glass rang out. Web-like cracks spread from the maiden's hands.\n\nThe science officer urgently pulled down the reset button. The surrounding sticky green film instantly retracted backward. The seemingly soft film tightly stuck to the maiden's skin. The maiden, who just cracked the glass with strength, was now wrapped tightly like a cicada pupa. Even if she struggled constantly, she couldn't escape such binding. The science officer took this opportunity to press the emergency button. A burst of white mist was injected. The solvent with sedative effect gradually weakened the maiden's struggle, and her eyes calmed down, looking expressionlessly at everyone outside the pod. After confirming the maiden had no further threat, everyone continued to study these left-behind materials. Documents written in common language were not hard to decipher, but some terms were too uncommon or ancient, difficult to understand, only relying on researchers to try step by step. However, there were no mistakes in between. After successfully finishing the final stage, the §Y\"success\"§! on the control panel relieved everyone. Perhaps waiting for this progress to complete, we can know what is special about the maiden under heavy defense."
   # 苏醒...
   gts_xinuo.205.a: "Awakening..."
   # 坠下的达摩克利斯
